978:- **Karis's dating (flag):** the first memorandum and the leaf about two hundred years old (Greyvane's nine renewal seals; the seventh issue between Greyvane's fourth and fifth renewals); the first three memoranda close the door, remove the exit, delete the name, each citing an article of the standardization directive.
