editions/monroe-1.3/book-05-the-silver-standard/manuscript/chapter-08.md-57-The buried Copper had fought before breakfast, on the same floor, and had finished her bout so fast that Cael had missed it entirely. By the fourth bell the whole second floor knew about her.
