editions/monroe-1.3/book-05-the-silver-standard/manuscript/chapter-08.md:59:Her name on the card was a line like any other: a market house in the hills, Iron Skin Path, Copper Rank Four. Rooke's sheet on her had four bouts on it, every one won and every one short.
