books/book-02-iron-circuit/CHAPTER_ARCHITECTURE.md-476-After the circuit crowd clears, the scout approaches Cael where he's sitting with Brom and Lira. She introduces herself directly: Quenna, senior teaching-practitioner from Greyvane Academy, Silver-tier, specialization in irregular Path development assessment. She's been attending the Ironyard circuit on six separate occasions over the past two months. Dace knew her pass was academy-issued; he didn't know her specific institution until she told him tonight.
