editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/packets/MOVEMENT-008.md-20-- **The closings**: two hundred and six people, none dishonest; Jent's ten minutes; **Karis's fifty-one-minute closing** under the leave the counsel obtained (§11 #4) — the best argument the series stages, and it changes nothing; Jent: "the registry does not dispute a syllable of it"; **the declined certification entered as an absence** and four pens stopping.
